More reliable connections.

The app now recovers by itself after a network outage, notices a dead connection in about half a minute, and usually switches servers without disconnecting first.

Always-on VPN and "Block connections without VPN" are now supported.

Outside Stealth Mode, the app's own requests to our servers now go through the VPN.

If the kill switch cannot block traffic, the app now tells you.

Stealth Mode connects again, and stops rather than falling back silently.
